Chapter: CompositePlanting
  cites Uoaix chapter CompositeProduction
  cites Uoaix chapter WorldFlora

 A player plants a timber sapling (item 56) on a free ground tile: the tile becomes an owned plot planted with
 timber (EconomyHarvest eh-ground, eh-plant) and a harvest site, which UHC1 persists. A planted tree draws as
 world items under serials 7D000001 and up, two a site (the sapling or trunk, then the leaves).
  CplRequest = record { serial : Integer, target : Integer, lot : Integer, expires : Integer, resource : Integer }
  CplViewer = record { connection : Integer, sent : Integer, used : Integer, room : Integer }
  CplState = record { requests : List CplRequest, nonce : Integer, viewers : List CplViewer, clock : Integer }
  cpl-serial-base : Integer = #7D000000
  cpl-context : Integer = #504C0000
 Timber is resource 15 on ground kind 2; its seed is item 56 (EconomyCatalog).
  cpl-resource : Integer = 15
  cpl-ground : Integer = 2
  cpl-sapling : Integer = 56
 TILEDATA art: sapling 0x0CE9, oak trunk 0x0CDA and oak leaves 0x0CDB, stump 0x0E56.
  cpl-sapling-art : Integer = #0CE9
  cpl-trunk-art : Integer = #0CDA
  cpl-leaves-art : Integer = #0CDB
 A fruit tree (resource 16) is TILEDATA's apple tree 0x0D94 with leaves 0x0D95; it is picked by hand, not chopped.
  cpl-trunk : Integer -> Integer
  cpl-trunk (resource) = if resource == 16 then #0D94 else if resource == 39 then #0DA4 else if resource == 41 then #0D9C else cpl-trunk-art
  cpl-leaves : Integer -> Integer
  cpl-leaves (resource) = if resource == 16 then #0D95 else if resource == 39 then #0DA5 else if resource == 41 then #0D9D else cpl-leaves-art
 TILEDATA "apple tree fruit": the leaves 0x0D96 that stand on trunk 0x0D94 while its fruit is ripe, as the loaded trees
 inside Castle Britain's gates pair their trunks (DWD1 0x0D98 with 0x0D9A).
  cpl-fruit-art : Integer = #0D96
 TILEDATA "pear tree": trunk 0x0DA4, bare leaves 0x0DA5 and the loaded leaves 0x0DA6; "peach tree": 0x0D9C, 0x0D9D and 0x0D9E.
  cpl-fruit : Integer -> Integer
  cpl-fruit (resource) = if resource == 39 then #0DA6 else if resource == 41 then #0D9E else cpl-fruit-art
  cpl-orchard : Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-orchard (resource) = resource == 16 | resource == 39 | resource == 41
 The 1.25 client draws every grapevine (0x0D1B..0x0D24) hung with grapes and has no bare vine, so a picked vine keeps
 the same art and only its name says it is picked (Damian, 2026-10-07: "just use text messages instead of graphical
 indicators").
 TILEDATA pairs each of these trunks with its leaves or needles one id above it; the jungle and yew trunks have no
 single leaves tile and stand bare.
  cpl-species-leaves : Integer -> Integer
  cpl-species-leaves (t) = if t == #0CCD | t == #0CD0 | t == #0CD3 | t == #0CD6 | t == #0CD8 | t == #0CDA | t == #0CDD
    | t == #0CE0 | t == #0CE3 | t == #0CE6 | t == #0CF8 | t == #0CFB | t == #0CFE | t == #0D01 then t + 1 else 0
  cpl-trunk-of : GhSite -> Integer
  cpl-trunk-of (site) = if site.species /= 0 then site.species else cpl-trunk site.resource
  cpl-leaves-of : GhSite -> Integer
  cpl-leaves-of (site) = if site.species /= 0 then cpl-species-leaves site.species else cpl-leaves site.resource
  cpl-ripe : GameHarvest, Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-ripe (h) (k) = (cpl-orchard (cpl-site h k).resource | (cpl-site h k).resource == 27) & (cpl-node h k).stage == 2 & h.vendor.currency.world.hour >= (cpl-node h k).ready
  cpl-stump-art : Integer = #0E56
  cpl-requests : Integer, List CplRequest -> List CplRequest
  cpl-requests (left) (xs) = if left == 0 then xs else cpl-requests (left - 1) (list-push xs (CplRequest { serial = 0, target = 0, lot = -1, expires = 0, resource = 0 }))
  cpl-seed-resource : EpWorld, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cpl-seed-resource (w) (item) (i) = if item <= 0 | i >= list-length w.catalog.resources then 0
    else if (list-at w.catalog.resources i).seed == item then i + 1 else cpl-seed-resource w item (i + 1)
 Timber (15) and fruit (16) grow as trees; every other seeded resource grows as a crop.
  cpl-tree : Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-tree (resource) = resource == 15 | cpl-orchard resource
 TILEDATA crop art: sprouts 0x0C68 while young; cotton 0x0C4F, flax 0x1A99, wheat 0x0C55, cabbage 0x0C7B for
 vegetables, ginseng 0x18E9, garlic 0x18E1, mandrake 0x18DF, nightshade 0x18E5 and grapevines 0x0D1D (resource 27)
 when mature; resources 28-38 (BritainCatalog) use carrots 0x0C76, onions 0x0C6F, lettuce 0x0C70, turnip 0x0C61,
 corn stalk 0x0C7D, pumpkin 0x0C6A, squash 0x0C72, honeydew 0x0C74, watermelon 0x0C5C, gourd 0x0C64 and hops 0x1A9E. The 1.25 client does not pick an item whose art weighs 255 under a target cursor (Damian 2026-10-06:
 wheat, cotton and sprouts did not highlight, flax at 0, cabbage and mandrake at 1 did), so a weight-255 crop is
 drawn with the 0x1A movable flag 0x20.
  cpl-crop-art : Integer -> Integer
  cpl-crop-art (resource) = if resource == 10 then #0C4F else if resource == 11 then #1A99 else if resource == 13 then #0C55
    else if resource == 14 then #0C7B else if resource == 17 then #18E9 else if resource == 18 then #18E1
    else if resource == 19 then #18DF else if resource == 20 then #18E5 else if resource == 27 then #0D1D
    else if resource == 28 then #0C76 else if resource == 29 then #0C6F else if resource == 30 then #0C70
    else if resource == 31 then #0C61 else if resource == 32 then #0C7D else if resource == 33 then #0C6A
    else if resource == 34 then #0C72 else if resource == 35 then #0C74 else if resource == 36 then #0C5C
    else if resource == 37 then #0C64 else if resource == 38 then #1A9E else #0C68
 Weight 255 in TILEDATA (measured 2026-10-07): cotton, wheat, sprouts, grapevines, carrots, onions, turnip, corn stalk.
  cpl-heavy-art : Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-heavy-art (art) = art == #0C4F | art == #0C55 | art == #0C68 | art == #0D1D | art == #0C76 | art == #0C6F
    | art == #0C61 | art == #0C7D
  cpl-viewers : Integer, List CplViewer -> List CplViewer
  cpl-viewers (left) (xs) = if left == 0 then xs
    else let sent = alloc-bytes 256
    in let cleared = wf-fill sent 0 256 0
    in cpl-viewers (left - 1) (list-push xs (CplViewer { connection = -1, sent = sent, used = 0, room = 256 }))
 A viewer's sent stages are one byte per harvest site, grown with GameHarvest's site table at the growth point (cs-grow).
  cpl-fit : CplState, Integer -> Integer
  cpl-fit (state) (sites) = cpl-fit-from state.viewers sites 0
  cpl-fit-from : List CplViewer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cpl-fit-from (viewers) (sites) (i) = if i >= list-length viewers then 0
    else let v = list-at viewers i
    in let grown = if sites <= v.room then 0
      else let fresh = alloc-bytes sites
      in let copied = wf-copy v.sent fresh 0 v.room
      in let filled = wf-fill fresh v.room sites 0
      in let a = __record-set v "sent" fresh
      in let b = __record-set v "room" sites in 1
    in grown + cpl-fit-from viewers sites (i + 1)
 A planted site's items take serials base + 2k + 1 and + 2 for the live sites k.
  cpl-ours : GameHarvest, Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-ours (h) (serial) = serial > cpl-serial-base & serial <= cpl-serial-base + 2 * list-length h.sites
  cpl-new : Integer -> CplState
  cpl-new (unused) = CplState { requests = cpl-requests 8 [], nonce = 0, viewers = cpl-viewers 8 [], clock = 0 }
  cpl-denied : Text -> Result (Maybe GameReply) Text
  cpl-denied (text) = Ok (Just (gsi-denied text))
  cpl-flora-at : Maybe WfState, Integer, Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-flora-at (flora) (x) (y) = when flora
    is None -> False
    is Just (s) -> let block = (x / 8) * 512 + y / 8 in cpl-row-at s x y (wf-first s block) (wf-first s (block + 1))
  cpl-row-at : WfState, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-row-at (s) (x) (y) (i) (last) = if i >= last then False else if wf-x s i == x & wf-y s i == y then True else cpl-row-at s x y (i + 1) last
 A site index outside the sites, or a site whose node is 0 or past node-count, reads as an empty node (planted 0), which
 every caller treats as a bare plot instead of reading sites[-1] or nodes[-1].
  cpl-site : GameHarvest, Integer -> GhSite
  cpl-site (h) (k) = if k < 0 | k >= list-length h.sites then GhSite { x = 0, y = 0, z = 0, resource = 0, node = 0, base = 0, species = 0, felled = 0 } else list-at h.sites k
  cpl-node : GameHarvest, Integer -> EpNode
  cpl-node (h) (k) = let node = (cpl-site h k).node
    in if node < 1 | node > h.vendor.currency.world.node-count | node > list-length h.vendor.currency.world.nodes then EpNode { resource = 0, place = 0, owner = 0, ground = 0, planted = 0, stage = 0, ready = 0, water = 0, tended = 0 }
    else list-at h.vendor.currency.world.nodes (node - 1)
  cpl-planted : GameHarvest, Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-planted (h) (k) = (cpl-node h k).planted == 1 & (cpl-node h k).resource == (cpl-site h k).resource
 Double-click: an owned sapling lot asks for a ground target; one's own planted sapling is tended, then watered.
  cpl-begin : CplState, GameHarvest, GameShard, GameInput, Integer, Integer -> Result (Maybe GameReply) Text
  cpl-begin (state) (h) (shard) (input) (serial) (now) = let v = h.vendor
    in let at = gv-lot v serial 0
    in if at < 0 then Ok None
    else let lot = ep-lot v.currency.world.goods at
    in let resource = cpl-seed-resource v.currency.world lot.item 0
    in if resource == 0 then Ok None
    else let player = gv-player v input.session.serial 0
    in let slot = gsi-slot shard input.session.serial 0
    in if player < 0 | slot < 0 | slot >= 8 | lot.actor /= (list-at v.players player).actor then cpl-denied "That seed is not yours."
    else if state.nonce > 65535 then cpl-denied "Planting target contexts exhausted."
    else let request = list-at state.requests slot
    in let target = cpl-context + state.nonce
    in let counted = __record-set state "nonce" (state.nonce + 1)
    in let a = __record-set request "serial" input.session.serial
    in let b = __record-set request "target" target
    in let c = __record-set request "lot" serial
    in let d = __record-set request "expires" (now + gh-ticks 10000)
    in let r = __record-set request "resource" resource
    in let cursor = sip-target target
    in let ground = list-set-at cursor 1 1
    in Ok (Just (gs-reply [cursor, sip-message #FFFFFFFF #FFFF 6 (if cpl-tree resource then "Where do you plant the seed?" else "Where do you sow it?")] "planting target"))
 A bed is reaped, tended, watered or dug from within 2 tiles, the harvest reach (GameHarvest), refused as UOX3 393.
  cpl-far : GameHarvest, GameInput, Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-far (h) (input) (k) = let site = cpl-site h k
    in when world-get h.items.world input.session.serial
      is Err (_) -> True
      is Ok (mobile) -> walk-abs (site.x - mobile.x) > 2 | walk-abs (site.y - mobile.y) > 2
  cpl-care : GameHarvest, GameInput, Integer -> Result (Maybe GameReply) Text
  cpl-care (h) (input) (k) = let v = h.vendor
    in let player = gv-player v input.session.serial 0
    in if k < 0 | k >= h.count | not (cpl-planted h k) then Ok None
    else if cpl-far h input k then cpl-denied "That is too far away."
    else if player >= 0 & (cpl-node h k).owner /= (list-at v.players player).actor & eh-common v.currency.world (cpl-node h k) then
      (if (cpl-node h k).stage == 2 & (cpl-site h k).resource == 27 & not (cpl-ripe h k) then cpl-denied "There are no grapes on it yet."
      else if (cpl-node h k).stage == 2 & cpl-orchard (cpl-site h k).resource & not (cpl-ripe h k) then cpl-denied "There is no fruit on it yet."
      else if (cpl-node h k).stage == 2 & cpl-need h k > 0 then cpl-denied (cpl-dig-with (cpl-need h k))
      else if (cpl-node h k).stage == 2 & (cpl-site h k).resource /= 15 then cpl-reap h (list-at v.players player) k
      else if (cpl-node h k).stage >= 2 then cpl-denied "That needs no more care."
      else cpl-denied "The crown's gardeners tend that.")
    else if player < 0 | (cpl-node h k).owner /= (list-at v.players player).actor then cpl-denied "You did not plant that."
    else let n = cpl-node h k
    in let w = v.currency.world
    in let actor = (list-at v.players player).actor
    in if n.stage == 2 & (cpl-site h k).resource == 27 & not (cpl-ripe h k) then cpl-denied "There are no grapes on it yet."
    else if n.stage == 2 & cpl-orchard (cpl-site h k).resource & not (cpl-ripe h k) then cpl-denied "There is no fruit on it yet."
    else if n.stage == 2 & cpl-need h k > 0 then cpl-denied (cpl-dig-with (cpl-need h k))
    else if n.stage == 2 & (cpl-site h k).resource /= 15 then cpl-reap h (list-at v.players player) k
    else if n.stage >= 2 then cpl-denied "That needs no more care."
    else if n.tended == 0 & not (cpl-roll h (list-at v.players player) (cpl-site h k).resource) then cpl-denied "You fail to tend the plant."
    else if n.tended == 0 then (if eh-care w actor (cpl-site h k).node False < 0 then cpl-denied "You cannot tend that now." else Ok (Just (gs-reply [sip-message #FFFFFFFF #FFFF 6 ("You tend the " & cpl-young w (cpl-site h k).resource & ".")] "planting tend")))
    else if n.water == 0 then (if eh-care w actor (cpl-site h k).node True < 0 then cpl-denied ("You need water for the " & cpl-young w (cpl-site h k).resource & ".") else Ok (Just (gs-reply [sip-message #FFFFFFFF #FFFF 6 ("You water the " & cpl-young w (cpl-site h k).resource & ".")] "planting water")))
    else cpl-denied ("The " & cpl-young w (cpl-site h k).resource & " is tended and watered.")
 Sowing and tending roll and practise the resource's client skill (Farming for crops, F55) in the player's row.
  cpl-roll : GameHarvest, GvPlayer, Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-roll (h) (player) (resource) = let w = h.vendor.currency.world
    in let r = list-at w.catalog.resources (resource - 1)
    in let bound = gh-row h.vendor player
    in ep-practice-as (ep-actor w player.actor) r.skill (ep-classic r.skill 0 r.item)
 A mature crop is reaped by hand (crops take no tool): its yield goes to the backpack and the bed starts again; a
 reap gives no seed (root for Damian, 2026-10-07: "reap gives the crop").
  cpl-item-name : EpWorld, Integer -> Text
  cpl-item-name (w) (item) = if item < 1 | item > list-length w.catalog.items then "crop" else (list-at w.catalog.items (item - 1)).name
  cpl-young : EpWorld, Integer -> Text
  cpl-young (w) (resource) = if resource == 15 then "young tree" else if resource == 16 then "young fruit tree" else if resource == 39 then "young pear tree" else if resource == 41 then "young peach tree"
    else "young " & cpl-item-name w (list-at w.catalog.resources (resource - 1)).item
  cpl-reap : GameHarvest, GvPlayer, Integer -> Result (Maybe GameReply) Text
  cpl-reap (h) (player) (k) = let w = h.vendor.currency.world
    in let site = cpl-site h k
    in let r = list-at w.catalog.resources (site.resource - 1)
    in let bound = gh-row h.vendor player
    in let produced = 100 + ep-level (ep-actor w player.actor) r.skill (ep-classic r.skill 0 r.item) * 9 / 10
    in let quantity = eh-harvest w player.actor site.node
    in if quantity == -2 then cpl-denied "You fail to gather anything."
    else if quantity < 1 then cpl-denied "There is nothing to reap."
    else let seeded = (site.resource == 39 | site.resource == 41) & r.seed > 0
    in let unseeded = if r.seed > 0 & not seeded then eh-add-yield w (ep-actor w player.actor) r.seed (0 - 1) 1000 else 0
    in when gh-output h player r.item quantity produced (site.x * 4096 + site.y)
      is Err (e) -> Err e
      is Ok (crop) -> when (if seeded then gh-place h player r.seed 1 (gh-grade 1000) (if list-length w.catalog.items >= 68 then 1 else 0) (site.x * 4096 + site.y + 1) else Ok [])
        is Err (e) -> Err e
        is Ok (seed) -> let reaped = [crop, sip-message #FFFFFFFF #FFFF 6 ("You reap the " & cpl-item-name w r.item & ".")]
          in let pricked = if site.resource == cpr-prick-resource then cpr-prick h.items.world player.serial else -1
          in let said = if pricked < 0 then reaped else list-push reaped (sip-message player.serial 0 6 cpr-prick-line)
          in Ok (Just (gs-reply (if list-length seed == 0 then said else list-push said seed) (if pricked < 0 then "planting reaped" else "planting pricked")))
 Target: a free ground tile within two, with no flora, harvest site or object on it.
  cpl-target : CplState, GameHarvest, Maybe WfState, GameShard, GameInput, WalkMap, List Integer, Integer -> Result (Maybe GameReply) Text
  cpl-target (state) (h) (flora) (shard) (input) (map) (packet) (now) = let slot = gsi-slot shard input.session.serial 0
    in if slot < 0 | slot >= 8 then Ok None
    else let request = list-at state.requests slot
    in if request.target == 0 | request.target /= gp-u32 packet 2 | request.serial /= input.session.serial then cpl-denied "That planting target is no longer active."
    else let lot-serial = request.lot
    in let species = (when world-get h.items.world lot-serial is Err (_) -> 0 is Ok (seed) -> if request.resource == 15 & cpr-tree seed.health then seed.health else 0)
    in let resource = request.resource
    in let clear = __record-set request "target" 0
    in let x = gp-u16 packet 11
    in let y = gp-u16 packet 13
    in if x == 65535 | y == 65535 then Ok (Just (gs-reply [] "planting cancelled"))
    else if now > request.expires then cpl-denied "That planting target expired."
    else let v = h.vendor
    in let at = gv-lot v lot-serial 0
    in let player = gv-player v input.session.serial 0
    in if resource < 1 | resource > list-length v.currency.world.catalog.resources then cpl-denied "That planting target is no longer active."
    else if at < 0 | player < 0 | (ep-lot v.currency.world.goods at).item /= (list-at v.currency.world.catalog.resources (resource - 1)).seed | ep-lot-amount v.currency.world.goods at < 1 | (ep-lot v.currency.world.goods at).actor /= (list-at v.players player).actor then cpl-denied "The seed is no longer yours."
    else when world-get shard.world input.session.serial
      is Err (e) -> Err e
      is Ok (mobile) -> let cell = walk-cell map x y
        in if gp-u32 packet 7 /= 0 | gp-u16 packet 17 /= 0 | cell < 0 | not (walk-ready map x y) then cpl-denied "Plant it on open ground."
        else if walk-abs (x - mobile.x) > 2 | walk-abs (y - mobile.y) > 2 | (x == mobile.x & y == mobile.y) then cpl-denied "That spot is out of reach."
        else let z = walk-z map x y
        in if peek-qword map.solids (cell * map.stride) /= 0 | world-tile-first shard.world x y /= 0 | cpl-flora-at flora x y | gh-site-find h resource x y z 0 >= 0 then cpl-denied "Something already grows or stands there."
        else if h.count >= list-length h.sites then cpl-denied "Nothing more can be planted."
        else let w = v.currency.world
        in let actor = (list-at v.players player).actor
        in if not (cpl-roll h (list-at v.players player) resource) then cpl-denied "You fail to plant the seed."
        else let plot = eh-ground w actor (ep-actor w actor).place (list-at w.catalog.resources (resource - 1)).ground
        in if plot < 1 then cpl-denied "That ground cannot be planted."
        else if eh-plant-from w actor plot resource lot-serial < 0 then cpl-denied "It will not take there."
        else when cpl-debit h lot-serial
          is Err (e) -> Err e
          is Ok (update) -> let site = list-at h.sites h.count
            in let a = __record-set site "x" x
            in let b = __record-set site "y" y
            in let c = __record-set site "z" z
            in let d = __record-set site "resource" resource
            in let e = __record-set site "node" plot
            in let f = __record-set site "species" species
            in let g = __record-set site "felled" 0
            in let counted = __record-set h "count" (h.count + 1)
            in let touched = world-touch shard.world
            in Ok (Just (gs-reply [update, sip-message #FFFFFFFF #FFFF 6 ("You plant the " & cpl-young w resource & ".")] "planting planted"))
  cpl-debit : GameHarvest, Integer -> Result (List Integer) Text
  cpl-debit (h) (serial) = let quoted = gh-invalidate-quotes h.vendor 0
    in when world-get h.items.world serial
      is Err (_) -> Ok (sip-remove serial)
      is Ok (item) -> Ok (sip-item item)
  cpl-handler : CplState, GameHarvest, Maybe WfState, GameShard, GameInput, WalkMap, List Integer, Integer -> Result (Maybe GameReply) Text
  cpl-handler (state) (h) (flora) (shard) (input) (map) (packet) (now) = if list-length packet == 0 then Ok None
    else let op = list-at packet 0
    in if op == 6 & list-length packet == 5 then
      (let serial = bit-and (gp-u32 packet 1) #7FFFFFFF
      in if input.mode /= 2 | input.session.phase /= 2 then Ok None
      else if cpl-ours h serial then cpl-care h input ((serial - cpl-serial-base - 1) / 2)
      else cpl-begin state h shard input serial now)
    else if (op == 7 | op == 9) & list-length packet >= 5 & cpl-ours h (bit-and (gp-u32 packet 1) #7FFFFFFF) then
      Ok (Just (if op == 7 then gs-reply [sip-bounce 0] "planting:immovable" else cpl-name h (bit-and (gp-u32 packet 1) #7FFFFFFF)))
    else if op == 9 & list-length packet == 5 then cpl-lot-name h shard (gp-u32 packet 1)
    else if op == #6C & list-length packet == 19 & cpl-ours h (bit-and (gp-u32 packet 7) #7FFFFFFF) then
      (if input.mode /= 2 | input.session.phase /= 2 then Ok None else cpl-tool h input packet)
    else if op == #6C & list-length packet == 19 & bit-and (gp-u32 packet 2) #FFFF0000 == cpl-context then
      (if input.mode /= 2 | input.session.phase /= 2 then Ok None else cpl-target state h flora shard input map packet now)
    else Ok None
 Each viewer remembers what it drew per site: 0 nothing, 1 sapling, 2 trunk and leaves, 3 stump, 7 and 8 a map tree's bare or fruited leaves.
  cpl-label : GameHarvest, Integer -> Text
  cpl-label (h) (k) = if k < 0 | k >= h.count | not (cpl-planted h k) then "a bare plot"
    else let site = cpl-site h k
    in let w = h.vendor.currency.world
    in let name = (list-at w.catalog.items ((list-at w.catalog.resources (site.resource - 1)).item - 1)).name
    in let stage = (cpl-node h k).stage
    in if site.resource == 15 then (if stage == 2 then "a tree (chop it with a hatchet)" else if stage == 3 | (stage == 0 & site.felled == 1) then "a stump" else "a sapling")
    else if site.resource == 16 then (if stage == 2 then "an apple tree (double-click to pick its fruit)" else "a fruit sapling")
    else if site.resource == 27 then (if stage /= 2 then "young grapevines" else if cpl-ripe h k then "grapevines (double-click to pick the grapes)" else "a grapevine (picked)")
    else if site.resource == 39 then (if stage == 2 then "a pear tree (double-click to pick its pears)" else "a pear sapling")
    else if site.resource == 41 then (if stage == 2 then "a peach tree (double-click to pick its peaches)" else "a peach sapling")
    else if stage == 2 then name & (if cpl-need h k == 28 then " (dig it with a trowel)" else if cpl-need h k == 25 then " (dig it up with a shovel)" else if cpl-need h k == 120 then " (reap it with a pitchfork)" else " (double-click to pick it)") else "young " & name
 A seed or a seeded crop lot is named by its catalog item ("wheat seed", "wheat"), since the client's art name
 for the seed pile and for the young crop says neither.
  cpl-farm-item : EpWorld, Integer, Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-farm-item (w) (item) (i) = if i >= list-length w.catalog.resources then False
    else let r = list-at w.catalog.resources i
    in if r.seed > 0 & (r.seed == item | r.item == item) then True else cpl-farm-item w item (i + 1)
  cpl-lot-name : GameHarvest, GameShard, Integer -> Result (Maybe GameReply) Text
  cpl-lot-name (h) (shard) (serial) = let v = h.vendor
    in let at = gv-lot v serial 0
    in if at < 0 then Ok None
    else let item = (ep-lot v.currency.world.goods at).item
    in if not (cpl-farm-item v.currency.world item 0) then Ok None
    else when world-get shard.world serial
      is Err (_) -> Ok None
      is Ok (o) -> Ok (Just (gs-reply [sip-message serial o.graphic 6 ((if o.amount > 1 then show o.amount & " " else "") & cpl-item-name v.currency.world item)] "planting:lot-name"))
  cpl-name : GameHarvest, Integer -> GameReply
  cpl-name (h) (serial) = gs-reply [sip-message serial 0 6 (cpl-label h ((serial - cpl-serial-base - 1) / 2))] "planting:name"
  cpl-request : GameHarvest, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cpl-request (h) (context) (i) = if i == list-length h.requests then -1
    else if context /= 0 & (list-at h.requests i).target == context then i else cpl-request h context (i + 1)
  cpl-tool : GameHarvest, GameInput, List Integer -> Result (Maybe GameReply) Text
  cpl-tool (h) (input) (packet) = let r = cpl-request h (gp-u32 packet 2) 0
    in let v = h.vendor
    in let player = gv-player v input.session.serial 0
    in let k = (bit-and (gp-u32 packet 7) #7FFFFFFF - cpl-serial-base - 1) / 2
    in if r < 0 | player < 0 | k >= h.count then Ok None
    else if (list-at h.requests r).serial /= input.session.serial | not (cpl-planted h k) then Ok None
    else if cpl-far h input k then cpl-denied "That is too far away."
    else let lot = gh-tool h (list-at v.players player) (list-at h.requests r).tool
    in let item = if lot < 0 then 0 else (ep-lot v.currency.world.goods lot).item
    in let resource = (cpl-site h k).resource
    in if item == 26 & resource == 15 then Ok None
    else let clear = __record-set (list-at h.requests r) "target" 0
    in let need = cpl-need h k
    in if not (cpl-tree resource) & item == need & (need == 28 | need == 25 | need == 120) then cpl-dig h (list-at v.players player) k
    else cpl-denied (if cpl-orchard resource then "Pick its fruit by hand." else if resource == 15 then "Chop it with a hatchet." else if need > 0 then cpl-dig-with need else "Pick it by hand.")
 Damian, 2026-10-07: "some crops don't require tools to harvest, they still say use a shovel. the trowel was for doing
 like mandrake and stuff." A crop's catalog tool decides: 0 is picked by hand (double-click), 28 the trowel digs
 (ginseng, garlic, mandrake, nightshade), 25 the shovel digs (carrots, onions, turnips). Damian, the same day: "I am
 imagining a small hand tool, one handed gardening shovel. maybe that is a trowel. in any event, that thing for doing the
 little crops, shovels for like digging up turnips and carrots".
  cpl-dig-with : Integer -> Text
  cpl-dig-with (tool) = if tool == 28 then "Dig it with a trowel." else if tool == 25 then "Dig it up with a shovel." else if tool == 120 then "Reap it with a pitchfork." else "Pick it by hand."
  cpl-need : GameHarvest, Integer -> Integer
  cpl-need (h) (k) = let w = h.vendor.currency.world
    in let resource = (cpl-site h k).resource
    in if resource < 1 | resource > list-length w.catalog.resources then 0 else (list-at w.catalog.resources (resource - 1)).tool
  cpl-dig : GameHarvest, GvPlayer, Integer -> Result (Maybe GameReply) Text
  cpl-dig (h) (player) (k) = let n = cpl-node h k
    in if n.owner /= player.actor & not (eh-common h.vendor.currency.world n) then cpl-denied "You did not plant that."
    else if n.stage /= 2 then cpl-denied "That is not ready to reap."
    else cpl-reap h player k
  cpl-viewer : CplState, Integer -> CplViewer
  cpl-viewer (state) (connection) = let found = cpl-viewer-find state.viewers connection 0
    in let v = list-at state.viewers (if found >= 0 then found else cpl-viewer-oldest state.viewers 0 0)
    in let fresh = if found >= 0 then 0 else let cleared = wf-fill v.sent 0 v.room 0 in let c = __record-set v "connection" connection in 0
    in let tick = __record-set state "clock" (state.clock + 1)
    in let used = __record-set v "used" state.clock in v
  cpl-viewer-find : List CplViewer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cpl-viewer-find (viewers) (connection) (i) = if i == list-length viewers then -1
    else if (list-at viewers i).connection == connection then i else cpl-viewer-find viewers connection (i + 1)
  cpl-viewer-oldest : List CplViewer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cpl-viewer-oldest (viewers) (i) (best) = if i == list-length viewers then best
    else cpl-viewer-oldest viewers (i + 1) (if (list-at viewers i).used < (list-at viewers best).used then i else best)
  cpl-want : GameHarvest, Integer -> Integer
  cpl-want (h) (k) = if not (cpl-planted h k) then 0 else if cpl-map-tree (cpl-site h k) then (if cpl-ripe h k then 8 else 7) else let stage = (cpl-node h k).stage
    in let tree = cpl-tree (cpl-site h k).resource
    in if stage == 2 then (if (cpl-site h k).resource == 27 then (if cpl-ripe h k then 4 else 6) else if cpl-ripe h k then 5 else if tree then 2 else 4) else if stage == 3 then (if tree then 3 else 0)
    else if stage == 0 & tree then (if (cpl-site h k).felled == 1 & h.vendor.currency.world.hour < (cpl-node h k).ready - eh-span (cpl-site h k).resource 0 then 3 else 0) else 1
  cpl-item : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> List Integer
  cpl-item (serial) (art) (x) (y) (z) = if cpl-heavy-art art
    then sip-length (list-push (list-push (gp-put16 (gp-put16 (gp-put16 (gp-put32 [#1A,0,0] serial) art) x) (bit-or y #4000)) (bit-and z 255)) #20)
    else sip-length (list-push (gp-put16 (gp-put16 (gp-put16 (gp-put32 [#1A,0,0] serial) art) x) y) (bit-and z 255))
  cpl-draw : GameHarvest, Integer, Integer, Integer, List (List Integer) -> List (List Integer)
  cpl-draw (h) (k) (had) (want) (packets) = let site = cpl-site h k
    in let main = cpl-serial-base + k * 2 + 1
    in if had >= 7 | want >= 7 then cpl-draw-map site main had want packets
    else let dropped = if (had == 2 | had == 5) & want /= 2 & want /= 5 then list-push packets (sip-remove (main + 1)) else packets
    in if want == 0 then (if had == 0 then dropped else list-push dropped (sip-remove main))
    else let art = if want == 1 then (if cpl-tree site.resource then cpl-sapling-art else #0C68)
      else if want == 2 | want == 5 then cpl-trunk-of site else if want == 4 then cpl-crop-art site.resource else cpl-stump-art
    in let drawn = list-push dropped (cpl-item main (if want == 6 then cpl-crop-art site.resource else art) site.x site.y site.z)
    in if want == 2 then (if cpl-leaves-of site == 0 then drawn else list-push drawn (cpl-item (main + 1) (cpl-leaves-of site) site.x site.y site.z))
    else if want == 5 then list-push drawn (cpl-item (main + 1) (cpl-fruit site.resource) site.x site.y site.z) else drawn
 A map fruit tree's trunk is the decoration's; its leaves are drawn here so a pick shows (Damian, 2026-10-09: "don't have the
 same graphical change to show the tree empty of fruit"): TILEDATA pairs each fruit trunk with its bare leaves one id above
 and its fruited leaves two above (apple 0x0D94 and 0x0D98, peach 0x0D9C and 0x0DA0, pear 0x0DA4 and 0x0DA8).
  cpl-draw-map : GhSite, Integer, Integer, Integer, List (List Integer) -> List (List Integer)
  cpl-draw-map (site) (main) (had) (want) (packets) = let gone = if had >= 7 & want < 7 then list-push packets (sip-remove (main + 1)) else packets
    in if want >= 7 then list-push gone (cpl-item (main + 1) (site.species + (if want == 8 then 2 else 1)) site.x site.y site.z) else gone
  cpl-scan : GameHarvest, CplViewer, Integer, Integer, Integer, List (List Integer) -> List (List Integer)
  cpl-scan (h) (v) (x) (y) (k) (packets) = if k >= h.count | k >= v.room then packets
    else let site = cpl-site h k
    in let near = walk-abs (site.x - x) <= 18 & walk-abs (site.y - y) <= 18
    in let had = peek-byte v.sent k
    in let want = if near then cpl-want h k else 0
    in if had == want then cpl-scan h v x y (k + 1) packets
    else let set = poke-byte v.sent k want
    in cpl-scan h v x y (k + 1) (if near then cpl-draw h k had want packets else packets)
 A mature planted tree stands as its trunk: the trunk's TILEDATA collider is in the walk map while the node is
 mature and out of it otherwise, so the stage 3a lookup answers timber for a hatchet aimed at it.
  cpl-collide : GameHarvest, Integer, WalkMap, Integer -> Integer
  cpl-collide (h) (tiles) (map) (k) = if tiles == 0 | k >= h.count then 0
    else let site = cpl-site h k
    in let cell = walk-cell map site.x site.y
    in let changed = if cell < 0 | not (cpl-planted h k) | not (cpl-tree site.resource) | cpl-map-tree site then 0
      else let at = wf-tile-at (cpl-trunk-of site)
      in let flags = mul-u32 tiles at
      in let height = peek-byte tiles (at + 16)
      in let found = wf-solid-find map cell site.z height flags 0
      in let mature = (cpl-node h k).stage == 2
      in if mature & found < 0 then (when walk-add-solid map site.x site.y site.z height flags is Err (_) -> 0 is Ok (_) -> 1)
      else if not mature & found >= 0 then let dropped = wf-solid-drop map cell found in 1
      else 0
    in changed + cpl-collide h tiles map (k + 1)
 A hatchet aimed at a mature planted tree's item becomes the static target of its trunk.
  cpl-target-packet : GameHarvest, List Integer -> List Integer
  cpl-target-packet (h) (packet) = if list-length packet /= 19 | list-at packet 0 /= #6C then packet
    else let serial = bit-and (gp-u32 packet 7) #7FFFFFFF
    in if not (cpl-ours h serial) then packet
    else let k = (serial - cpl-serial-base - 1) / 2
    in if k >= h.count | not (cpl-planted h k) | (cpl-site h k).resource /= 15 | (cpl-node h k).stage /= 2 then packet
    else let site = cpl-site h k
    in let head = [list-at packet 0, list-at packet 1, list-at packet 2, list-at packet 3, list-at packet 4, list-at packet 5, list-at packet 6]
    in gp-put16 (list-push (list-push (gp-put16 (gp-put16 (gp-put32 head 0) site.x) site.y) (list-at packet 15)) (bit-and site.z 255)) (cpl-trunk-of site)
  cpl-view : CplState, GameHarvest, Integer, Integer, Integer -> List (List Integer)
  cpl-view (state) (h) (connection) (x) (y) = cpl-scan h (cpl-viewer state connection) x y 0 []
 The Royal Test Farm (UOAIX-58) is the farmhouse at 1223..1239,1567..1583. Each bed is resource, x, y in its farm field
 (Damian 2026-10-07: "there is a farm field next to the farm, and i want this stuff all planted out there, not on the
 green fringe next to the farm building"): MAP0.MUL furrows 1208..1239,1592..1615, every tile land z 0 with no static,
 in rows four tiles apart. Each furnishing is TILEDATA art, x, y on a free floor tile at z 0; the fireplace stands under
 the house's chimney static at 1227,1568.
  cpl-farm-beds : List (List Integer) = [[10, 1211, 1595], [11, 1215, 1595], [13, 1219, 1595], [14, 1223, 1595],
    [17, 1227, 1595], [18, 1231, 1595], [19, 1235, 1595], [20, 1211, 1600], [27, 1215, 1600], [15, 1219, 1600], [16, 1223, 1600],
    [28, 1227, 1600], [29, 1231, 1600], [30, 1235, 1600], [31, 1211, 1605], [32, 1215, 1605], [33, 1219, 1605], [34, 1223, 1605],
    [35, 1227, 1605], [36, 1231, 1605], [37, 1235, 1605], [38, 1211, 1610], [39, 1225, 1600], [41, 1215, 1610]]
 A world founded before the beds moved holds them on the grass at these tiles, one for one with the head of
 cpl-farm-beds; installation moves each such site to its field tile.
  cpl-farm-old-beds : List (List Integer) = [[10, 1222, 1587], [11, 1224, 1587], [13, 1226, 1587], [14, 1228, 1587],
    [17, 1230, 1587], [18, 1232, 1587], [19, 1234, 1587], [20, 1236, 1587], [27, 1238, 1587], [15, 1224, 1590], [16, 1230, 1590]]
  cpl-farm-move : GameHarvest, List (List Integer), List (List Integer), Integer -> Integer
  cpl-farm-move (h) (old) (beds) (i) = if i == list-length old then 0
    else let from = list-at old i
    in let to = list-at beds i
    in let k = gh-site-find h (list-at from 0) (list-at from 1) (list-at from 2) 0 0
    in let moved = if k < 0 | gh-site-find h (list-at to 0) (list-at to 1) (list-at to 2) 0 0 >= 0 then 0
      else let site = cpl-site h k
      in let a = __record-set site "x" (list-at to 1)
      in let b = __record-set site "y" (list-at to 2) in 1
    in moved + cpl-farm-move h old beds (i + 1)
  cpl-farm-furniture : List (List Integer) = [[#0935, 1227, 1569], [#09ED, 1228, 1569], [#0E7F, 1230, 1568],
    [#0E77, 1231, 1568], [#1039, 1227, 1572], [#0B2F, 1225, 1576], [#0B31, 1229, 1576], [#0A55, 1225, 1582],
    [#0A55, 1227, 1582], [#0E3D, 1230, 1582], [#1015, 1233, 1568], [#1039, 1238, 1568], [#0E77, 1238, 1569],
    [#0E77, 1238, 1570], [#0F34, 1233, 1573], [#0F34, 1234, 1573], [#1037, 1233, 1574], [#0E87, 1238, 1573],
    [#0E88, 1238, 1574], [#0B41, 1235, 1578], [#0B42, 1235, 1579], [#14E0, 1237, 1578]]
 The water trough 0x0B41/0x0B42 runs north-south, 0x0B42 south of 0x0B41 (ServUO WaterTroughEastAddon); worlds furnished
 before held 0x0B42 east of it, and that piece is removed.
  cpl-farm-stale : List (List Integer) = [[#0B42, 1236, 1578]]
 The Royal Mint (UOAIX-78) is the Castle British room at 1329..1339,1600..1608 on the z 72 floor (STATICS0.MUL; Damian
 stood at 1334,1603), doorways at 1333,1599, 1334,1609 and 1340,1604. Each furnishing is art, x, y, z; the table top is z 78.
 The brass sign hangs east of the wall beside the east doorway.
  cpl-mint-sign : Integer = #0BD2
  cpl-mint-sign-x : Integer = 1341
  cpl-mint-sign-y : Integer = 1603
  cpl-mint-furniture : List (List Integer) = [[#197A, 1329, 1600, 72], [#0FB1, 1330, 1600, 72], [#0FAF, 1330, 1601, 72],
    [#0B6B, 1337, 1600, 72], [#0B6B, 1338, 1600, 72], [#1852, 1337, 1600, 78], [#0EEF, 1338, 1600, 78],
    [#0EF2, 1337, 1606, 72], [#0EEF, 1338, 1606, 72], [#0EEC, 1339, 1606, 72], [#1BEB, 1329, 1606, 72],
    [#1BF5, 1330, 1606, 72], [#1BF4, 1329, 1607, 72], [#0E7C, 1338, 1608, 72], [cpl-mint-sign, cpl-mint-sign-x, cpl-mint-sign-y, 72]]
  cpl-mint-label : GameShard, List Integer -> Maybe GameReply
  cpl-mint-label (game) (packet) = if list-length packet /= 5 | list-at packet 0 /= 9 then None
    else let serial = bit-and (gp-u32 packet 1) #7FFFFFFF
    in when world-get game.world serial
      is Err (_) -> None
      is Ok (item) -> if item.kind /= 2 | item.graphic /= cpl-mint-sign | item.x /= cpl-mint-sign-x | item.y /= cpl-mint-sign-y | item.container /= 0 then None
        else Just (gs-reply [sip-message serial item.graphic 6 "Royal Mint"] "items:sign")
  cpl-farm-plant : GameHarvest, List (List Integer), Integer -> Integer
  cpl-farm-plant (h) (beds) (i) = if i == list-length beds then 0
    else let bed = list-at beds i
    in let resource = list-at bed 0
    in let x = list-at bed 1
    in let y = list-at bed 2
    in let w = h.vendor.currency.world
    in if w.mint-owner <= 0 | h.count >= list-length h.sites | gh-site-find h resource x y 0 0 >= 0 then cpl-farm-plant h beds (i + 1)
    else let node = eh-source w resource eh-royal-place
    in if node < 1 then cpl-farm-plant h beds (i + 1)
    else let n = list-at w.nodes (node - 1)
    in let a = __record-set n "owner" w.mint-owner
    in let b = __record-set n "planted" 1
    in let site = list-at h.sites h.count
    in let c = __record-set site "x" x
    in let d = __record-set site "y" y
    in let e = __record-set site "z" 0
    in let f = __record-set site "resource" resource
    in let g = __record-set site "node" node
    in let j = __record-set site "species" 0
    in let l = __record-set site "felled" 0
    in let counted = __record-set h "count" (h.count + 1)
    in 1 + cpl-farm-plant h beds (i + 1)
  cpl-farm-at : WorldTable, Integer, Integer -> Boolean
  cpl-farm-at (world) (serial) (art) = if serial == 0 then False
    else if (when world-get world serial is Err (_) -> False is Ok (o) -> o.kind == 2 & o.graphic == art & o.container == 0) then True
    else cpl-farm-at world (world-tile-next world serial) art
  cpl-farm-find : WorldTable, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cpl-farm-find (world) (serial) (art) = if serial == 0 then 0
    else if (when world-get world serial is Err (_) -> False is Ok (o) -> o.kind == 2 & o.graphic == art & o.container == 0) then serial
    else cpl-farm-find world (world-tile-next world serial) art
  cpl-farm-clear : GsiState, List (List Integer), Integer -> Integer
  cpl-farm-clear (items) (pieces) (i) = if i == list-length pieces then 0
    else let piece = list-at pieces i
    in let found = cpl-farm-find items.world (world-tile-first items.world (list-at piece 1) (list-at piece 2)) (list-at piece 0)
    in if found == 0 then cpl-farm-clear items pieces (i + 1)
    else when world-delete items.world found
      is Err (_) -> cpl-farm-clear items pieces (i + 1)
      is Ok (_) -> 1 + cpl-farm-clear items pieces (i + 1)
  cpl-farm-furnish : GsiState, List (List Integer), Integer -> Integer
  cpl-farm-furnish (items) (pieces) (i) = if i == list-length pieces then 0
    else let piece = list-at pieces i
    in let art = list-at piece 0
    in let x = list-at piece 1
    in let y = list-at piece 2
    in if cpl-farm-at items.world (world-tile-first items.world x y) art | world-room items.world <= 0 then cpl-farm-furnish items pieces (i + 1)
    else when world-create items.world (WorldObject { serial = 0, kind = 2, x = x, y = y, z = (if list-length piece > 3 then list-at piece 3 else 0), graphic = art, hue = 0, container = 0, amount = 1, health = 0 })
      is Err (_) -> cpl-farm-furnish items pieces (i + 1)
      is Ok (serial) -> let fixed = gsi-register items serial 0 0 False False
        in 1 + cpl-farm-furnish items pieces (i + 1)
  cpl-farm-install : GameHarvest -> Integer
  cpl-farm-install (h) = let moved = cpl-farm-move h cpl-farm-old-beds cpl-farm-beds 0
    in let planted = moved + cpl-farm-plant h cpl-farm-beds 0
    in let cleared = cpl-farm-clear h.items cpl-farm-stale 0
    in let furnished = cleared + cpl-farm-furnish h.items cpl-farm-furniture 0
    in let minted = cpl-farm-furnish h.items cpl-mint-furniture 0
    in let touched = if planted + furnished + minted > 0 then world-touch h.items.world else 0
    in planted + furnished + minted
 Castle Britain's orchard (Damian, 2026-10-09: "all these fruit trees in the castle grounds need to be harvestable") is the
 29 fruit trees of the decoration (DWD1) inside the castle walls, each trunk art, x, y at z 30, its leaves on the same tile;
 no other fruit tree stands in the Britain walk window, in decoration or flora (2026-10-09). TILEDATA trunks and leaves:
 apple 0x0D94..0x0D9B, peach 0x0D9C..0x0DA3, pear 0x0DA4..0x0DAB.
  cpl-castle-orchard : List (List Integer) = [[#0D9C, 1363, 1584], [#0D9C, 1363, 1589], [#0D94, 1363, 1595], [#0D98, 1363, 1601],
    [#0D98, 1363, 1606], [#0D98, 1363, 1651], [#0DA0, 1367, 1589], [#0DA0, 1367, 1595], [#0D94, 1367, 1601], [#0D94, 1367, 1606],
    [#0D9C, 1369, 1644], [#0D9C, 1369, 1658], [#0DA4, 1376, 1585], [#0DA4, 1376, 1590], [#0DA4, 1376, 1595], [#0DA4, 1376, 1600],
    [#0DA0, 1378, 1574], [#0DA0, 1378, 1579], [#0D9C, 1378, 1617], [#0D9C, 1378, 1620], [#0DA8, 1380, 1585], [#0DA8, 1380, 1590],
    [#0DA8, 1380, 1595], [#0DA8, 1380, 1600], [#0DA0, 1382, 1574], [#0DA0, 1382, 1579], [#0D94, 1386, 1574], [#0D94, 1386, 1579],
    [#0D94, 1390, 1579]]
  cpl-orchard-z : Integer = 30
 Peaches are resource 41 (BritainCatalog).
  cpl-map-orchard-resource : Integer -> Integer
  cpl-map-orchard-resource (art) = if art >= #0D94 & art <= #0D9B then 16 else if art >= #0D9C & art <= #0DA3 then 41 else if art >= #0DA4 & art <= #0DAB then 39 else 0
 A map tree's site is a crown orchard site whose species is the map trunk (a planted fruit tree's species is 0): the
 decoration draws and collides the tree, so the planting view draws nothing for it.
  cpl-map-tree : GhSite -> Boolean
  cpl-map-tree (site) = cpl-orchard site.resource & site.species /= 0
  cpl-orchard-plant : GameHarvest, List (List Integer), Integer -> Integer
  cpl-orchard-plant (h) (trees) (i) = if i == list-length trees then 0
    else let tree = list-at trees i
    in let art = list-at tree 0
    in let resource = cpl-map-orchard-resource art
    in let x = list-at tree 1
    in let y = list-at tree 2
    in let w = h.vendor.currency.world
    in if resource == 0 | w.mint-owner <= 0 | h.count >= list-length h.sites | gh-site-column h resource x y 0 >= 0 then cpl-orchard-plant h trees (i + 1)
    else let node = eh-source w resource eh-royal-place
    in if node < 1 then cpl-orchard-plant h trees (i + 1)
    else let n = list-at w.nodes (node - 1)
    in let a = __record-set n "owner" w.mint-owner
    in let b = __record-set n "planted" 1
    in let site = list-at h.sites h.count
    in let c = __record-set site "x" x
    in let d = __record-set site "y" y
    in let e = __record-set site "z" cpl-orchard-z
    in let f = __record-set site "resource" resource
    in let g = __record-set site "node" node
    in let j = __record-set site "species" art
    in let l = __record-set site "felled" 0
    in let counted = __record-set h "count" (h.count + 1)
    in 1 + cpl-orchard-plant h trees (i + 1)
  cpl-orchard-install : GameHarvest -> Integer
  cpl-orchard-install (h) = cpl-orchard-plant h cpl-castle-orchard 0
 A double-click on a map fruit tree's trunk or leaves names its orchard site, or -1.
  cpl-orchard-site : GameHarvest, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cpl-orchard-site (h) (art) (x) (y) = let resource = cpl-map-orchard-resource art
    in if resource == 0 then -1
    else let k = gh-site-column h resource x y 0
    in if k < 0 then -1 else if cpl-map-tree (cpl-site h k) then k else -1
